<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25399" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διανο-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for thinking, intellectual,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δ. κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					89a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετὴ δ.,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠθική,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1103a14
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμη δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1025b6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. μέρη,</span> of a play, parts
				<i>which display thought,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1460b4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. σύγκρισις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Nat.</u>
					14.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. φαντασίαι</span>
			<i>mental</i> images, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Fam.</u>
				15.16.1
			</span></i>; <i>discursive,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοερός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				415
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				219
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					1.14.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
